# LW-01 pilot: keep generated dependencies / builds / upstream Gameplay evidence
# out of Git. The vendored web/ trees remain byte-identical on disk; only the
# source, tests, tools and LW-01 evidence are tracked.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
web-large/evidence/
web-legacy/evidence/
!evidence/build.log
!evidence/qa-report.json
!evidence/verification.json
!evidence/shots/
!evidence/shots/*.png
